{
 "_readme": "Everything the build log pages print: section 03 on the homepage, /log/, one page per record under /log/<key>/, the two pooled photo pages (/log/live/, /log/build-day/) and /roundtable/. build.py reads this file and writes the pages; nothing here is typed into a template. ADD A RECORD (a 2BI cohort, a one-off milestone): one entry in `records` (key = its folder under /log/, dates, edition, `copy` naming a block in `copy`, photos) and its photos in assets/rec/ as <key>-lead.jpg + <key>-01.jpg ... The homepage's section 03 shows `home.featured` wide and the newest record of line `home.latest_line` beside it, so a new cohort takes the 2BI card by itself. ADD PHOTOS TO A POOLED PAGE (Live, Build Day): append to that collection's `photos`, each with `cap` saying which edition it is from. The Editions range on the page is counted from build/events.json (editions already held), not typed. PHOTOS: the first photo of a list is the lead (1600px on the long side), the rest are 960px, JPEG q78; `w`/`h` are the file's pixels, `orig` is the original's path inside the Drive asset library (~/Documents/Breakthrough-Assets/), `group` marks a posed group photo (it only changes the alt text). A record or collection may carry `og_focus` (0 = top, 1 = bottom, default 0.5): where its share picture (assets/og/<key>.jpg, cut 1200x630 from the lead photo) sits; delete the file in assets/og/ to have it cut again. The owner picks every photo himself on the picker page; nothing here is auto-selected. COPY: `text` is the short line on cards, `long` the paragraphs on the page (signed Jia Wei). Change words in the vault's SOT first, then here. ROUNDTABLE: `episodes` lists only episodes that are published on YouTube, numbered as YouTube numbers them and matched by the guest's name; the cover is assets/rt/<file>.jpg. Add an episode here when it is published, not before.",
 "home": {
  "featured": "bloc-batch-01-luncheon",
  "latest_line": "2bi"
 },
 "lines": {
  "2bi": "2BI",
  "bloc": "BLOC",
  "bsbb": "BSBB"
 },
 "where": "Shah Alam, Malaysia",
 "copy": {
  "2bi": {
   "text": "每一届来的人都不一样; 但是坐下来, 大家都是打开自己的电脑, 拿自己真实的生意, 亲手把自己的 2nd Brain build 出来。",
   "long": [
    "每一届来的人都不一样, 做的生意不一样, 走到的阶段不一样, 对 AI 的熟悉程度也不一样; 但是坐下来的那一刻, 大家想解决的其实是同一件事: 自己怎么做生意的那一套, 一直只放在自己的脑袋里。",
    "这两天我们做的, 就是把这些东西一样一样写下来, 写进属于自己的 2nd Brain。没有人替谁代做, 每个人都是打开自己的电脑, 拿自己真实的生意, 亲手把它 build 出来。过程不算轻松, 可是每一次看到有人发现 AI 做出来的东西终于像他自己, 我都会觉得这两天很值得。",
    "两天结束, 带回去的是一个认得自己的 2nd Brain, 还有一群同样愿意自己动手的人。"
   ]
  },
  "bloc-luncheon": {
   "text": "他们来自不同的背景, 有着不同的身份; 但是来到这里, 每个人就只是一个想认认真真把事情一件一件落实的人。走完半年, 我们没有办典礼, 只是一桌人坐下来好好吃一顿饭。",
   "long": [
    "这半年我最喜欢的, 是跟这群人一起 brainstorm 的时候。他们可能各自来自不同的背景, 有着不同的身份, 有过不同的经历; 但是他们来到这里, 每个人就只是一个想认认真真把心里想要完成的目标, 一件一件落地落实的人。",
    "他们遇到的问题各不相同, 需要的解法自然也不一样, 所以在这里, 从来没有一套谁都适用的标准答案。更多的时候, 是大家坐在一起, 你一言我一语地帮彼此把问题看清楚; 有时候自己以为卡在这一步, 旁人一听, 才发现真正卡住的地方其实在更前面。问题看准了, 接下来该怎么做, 心里往往也就有了答案。",
    "Brand Launch Off Challenge 就是这样一路走了半年。走完的那一天, 我们没有办什么典礼, 只是订了一间包间, 一桌人坐下来好好吃一顿饭, 聊的依然是各自手上正在做的事。我很珍惜能遇到这样一群志同道合的人, 不爱空谈, 只想踏踏实实把事情 build 出来。在 Breakthrough, 走进来的每一个人, 都是 builder。"
   ]
  }
 },
 "log": {
  "lede": "这里记着 Breakthrough 一路走来发生过的事, 每一件, 都是大家真的做出来的。"
 },
